<figure class="cache-figure" data-failure-deadline>
 <p class="figure-title">Every attempt spends the same request budget</p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><label>Cache wait <input type="range" min="10" max="150" step="10" value="40" aria-label="Cache attempt timeout" data-wait /><output data-wait-label>40 ms</output></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-retry /> Retry once after 20 ms backoff</label></div>
 <div class="deadline-track" data-track role="img" aria-label="Request timeline"></div>
 <div class="deadline-axis"><span>0 ms</span><span>100 ms</span><span>Deadline: 200 ms</span></div>
 <div class="deadline-legend"><span>Cache wait</span><span>Backoff</span><span>Source</span><span>Response</span></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Redis does not reply; each enabled wait ends at its timeout or the request deadline. The source needs 80 ms and response handling needs 10 ms in this fixed-duration model. Source work starts only if all 90 ms fit. Actual service times vary; a production deadline needs propagated remaining time and a policy for cancellation.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import {failureDeadline} from '../../lib/caching/failures.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-failure-deadline]').forEach(root=>{const wait=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-wait]')!,retry=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-retry]')!;const render=()=>{const s=failureDeadline({cacheWait:+wait.value,retry:retry.checked});root.querySelector('[data-wait-label]')!.textContent=`${wait.value} ms`;const track=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-track]')!;track.replaceChildren(...s.stages.map(stage=>{const bar=document.createElement('div');bar.className=stage.name.startsWith('Cache')?'cache-wait':stage.name.toLowerCase();bar.style.width=`${stage.duration/2}%`;bar.title=`${stage.name}: ${stage.duration} ms`;bar.textContent=String(stage.duration);return bar;}));track.setAttribute('aria-label',s.stages.map(x=>`${x.name} ${x.duration} milliseconds`).join(', '));root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=s.sourceAllowed?`The source answer fits. Response completes at ${s.elapsed} ms, with ${s.remaining} ms left.`:`Only ${s.remaining} ms remain after cache handling. The 90 ms source-and-response budget does not fit, so this request refuses fallback.`;};wait.oninput=retry.onchange=render;render();});
</script>
